  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Jacobsen Fleet Rates Delivery Overview Book a car Rent The fleet Rates and requirements Delivery Chauffeur Book a car Jacobsen How it works About Journal FAQ Contact Overview Car of the month Rolls-Royce Cullinan From \u20ac1,900 a day Puerto Ban\u00fas, Marbella. Delivered anywhere on the Costa del Sol. Book a car Journal . Coast 28 August 2026 The coast road to Sotogrande at sunset Forty-five kilometres west along the sea, a drink at the marina, and back with the lights of the coast on your right. Start Puerto Ban\u00fas Distance 45 km Time 45 minutes each way Best season All year, best from May to October Reading 1 min read Skip the motorway. The old coast road, the A-7, runs west from Puerto Ban\u00fas through Estepona and Manilva with the sea on your left most of the way, and in the hour before sunset it is one of the prettiest drives in Spain. The road It is not a fast road, and that is the point. The limit changes often through the towns, and the joy is in the light, the sea and a car that sounds good at sixty. A grand tourer is exactly right. Where to stop Estepona old town , for a walk through the flower-lined streets Puerto de la Duquesa , a small marina with fishing boats an",
